# The worked example from ROADMAP.md §3.6. Nobody says "return False",
# so the end of the function stays without a return (GAP003).

step 1
add root: for num~loopvar in nums:
    ...
expect gaps GAP002

step 2
fill h1:
    if num in seen:
        return True
expect gaps GAP001 GAP003

step 3
add root start: seen = set()
expect gaps GAP003

step 4
set n7.orelse = seen.add(num)  # ~synonym
expect gaps GAP003
